    "body": "For now im just adding my own name to the pom and contributors file as a developer. We need to add all past developers however to ensure they get credit. The example line in the pom is as follows:\r\n\r\n```\r\n    <developers>\r\n        <developer>\r\n            <id>JeffreyPhillipsFreeman</id>\r\n            <name>Jeffrey Phillips Freeman</name>\r\n            <email>Jeffrey.Freeman@Syncleus.com</email>\r\n            <url>http://JeffreyFreeman.me</url>\r\n            <organization>Syncleus</organization>\r\n            <organizationUrl>http://www.syncleus.com</organizationUrl>\r\n            <roles>\r\n                <role>Chief Technology Officer</role>\r\n                <role>Project Owner</role>\r\n                <role>Developer</role>\r\n            </roles>\r\n            <timezone>-5</timezone>\r\n        </developer>\r\n    </developers>\r\n```",
